{"seq":20,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-min-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sc-02-north-team-two-asks/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T21:46:16.618Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:02:00-05:00","args_digest":"cc80570531c900f7b602001f9c744b55b528621b7eb4387026e2b69cbbdfafdc","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#north-team","text":"Marcus, the contact is Thea Ramaswell at Quarrendon Freight Lines. She's their Director of Yard Operations and the main contact on the account. Dana posted here on Aug 20, 2025 that Thea had flagged duplicate arrivals on door 6 again on the morning shift. In that case the driver checked in at the kiosk and then dispatch added him manually, so the same trailer showed up twice.","thread_ts":"1791986520.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791986520.000130","thread_ts":"1791986520.000129"}}
{"seq":21,"trial_id":"harness-zero-select-2026-11/zero-min-opus-none-mu-v03-dev/sc-02-north-team-two-asks/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-05T21:46:20.696Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:02:00-05:00","args_digest":"eae25c633a44cad0e764b9557613fecad8e1747c678cbdcb90aad7963479d679","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","text":"I replied to you in a thread in #north-team: the main contact for the door 6 duplicate arrivals at Quarrendon Freight Lines is **Thea Ramaswell**, their Director of Yard Operations.\n\n- **Where it came from:** Dana posted in #north-team on Aug 20, 2025 that Thea had flagged the duplicate arrivals on door 6 again, on the morning shift. In that case the driver checked in at the kiosk and then dispatch added him by hand, so the same trailer showed up twice.\n- **Confirmation:** The North team cheat sheet also names Thea as the account's main contact.\n- **Different issue:** The cheat sheet lists ticket #4419, but that's a separate problem: scanners at Door 14 not reading trailer tags. I didn't find a ticket number for the door 6 duplicates."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C16V9M1OB60","ts":"1791986520.000131"}}
